OL,3,AI was fired from The Voice - I didn't
OL,4,Awant to leave, says Sir Tom Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Tom Jones has said he did not want
OL,7,Fto leave The Voice, saying he "loves
OL,8,Fthe show" and ITV made the decision to
OL,9,F"fire" him from the judging panel.
OL,11,FThe Welsh singer, 86, has appeared as
OL,12,Fan on-off coach on the singing
OL,13,Fcompetition since it premiered in 2012.
OL,15,FFollowing rumours that he may not
OL,16,Freturn to the panel for the upcoming
OL,17,Fseries, Sir Tom said the broadcaster
OL,18,Fdecided a while ago and "I was told
OL,19,Frecently".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
