OL,3,AI was fired from The Voice - I didn't
OL,4,Awant to leave, says Sir Tom Jones
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV has been asked to comment, but the
OL,7,FPress Association reported that a
OL,8,Fsource at the show was "hopeful" the
OL,9,Fsinger would return for its upcoming
OL,10,Fseries.
